{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301230","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1230123001:1":{"text":"물귀신파라고는 하지만, 사실 그들은 부두에 모인 일꾼 무리예요.","source_cn":"说是水鬼帮，其实就是一群聚在一起的码头工人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B96EE253C1DAB07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230123002:1":{"text":"약자를 괴롭힐 줄만 알고! 분명 블러디 로즈에 의해 러스트 항에서 쫓겨났던 기억이 선할 텐데 말이에요.","source_cn":"那群只会欺软怕硬的家伙，我记得他们已经被血薇帮赶出锈锚港了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164FEFC2B7C41A26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230123003:1":{"text":"쫓겨나긴 했지만, 물귀신파가 죽음의 함대와 손을 잡다니!","source_cn":"是被赶走了，但水鬼帮竟然又投靠了死潮舰队！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF63121FA8BF40DA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230123004:1":{"text":"약탈밖에 모르는 쓰레기들이죠. 블러디 로즈가 자비를 베풀지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"对待那群只知道掠夺的渣滓，血薇帮就不该仁慈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2274D60AABDF7E27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民莫利":{"text":"몰리","source":"村民莫利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:商人歌瑞尔":{"text":"상인 게인렐","source":"商人歌瑞尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}